{"info": {"address1": "Orient House", "address2": "Unit No. 21 to 25, 2nd Floor 3A Udyog Nagar Off S.V. Road, Goregaon (West)", "city": "Mumbai", "zip": "400062", "country": "India", "phone": "91 22 4223 2323", "fax": "91 22 4223 2313", "website": "https://www.pelhakoba.com", "industry": "Textile Manufacturing", "industryKey": "textile-manufacturing", "industryDisp": "Textile Manufacturing", "sector": "Consumer Cyclical", "sectorKey": "consumer-cyclical", "sectorDisp": "Consumer Cyclical", "longBusinessSummary": "Pioneer Embroideries Limited, together with its subsidiaries, engages in the manufacture of special polyester filament yarn, embroidery, and lace products in India. The company offers special polyester filament yarns, which include air texturised, carpet, twisted, fully drawn, draw textured, and partially oriented yarns under the SILKOLITE brand name. It also provides fashion and embroidery fabrics, salwar kameez dupattas, and sarees, as well as apparels under the Hakoba brand name. In addition, the company offers embroidery and lace products comprising guipure and fabric allovers and laces, as well as braided and fancy laces. Further, it provides dope dyed polyester yarns, elastics, embroidered dress materials and laces, flat bed knitted laces, motifs/collars/necks, and torchon/bobbin laces products. The company also exports its products. The company was incorporated in 1991 and is based in Mumbai, India.", "fullTimeEmployees": 1140, "companyOfficers": [{"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Raj Kumar Sekhani", "age": 66, "title": "Executive Chairman", "yearBorn": 1959, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 8400000, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Saurabh  Maheshwari", "age": 48, "title": "Executive Director", "yearBorn": 1977, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 4800000, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Deepak  Sipani", "age": 51, "title": "Chief Financial Officer", "yearBorn": 1974, "fiscalYear": 2